ber, and the prince collapses dead upon contact. The revelers, overcome with terror, seize the figure only to find it empty, revealing the Red Death itself has infiltrated the abbey, and one by one, all the guests die as the clock stops and darkness claims the abbey.</div>\n   794→                \n   795→                \n   796→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   797→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   798→                    \n   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">Prince Prospero</span>\n   800→                    \n   801→                    <span class=\"tag\">The courtiers</span>\n   802→                    \n   803→                    <span class=\"tag\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\n   804→                    \n   805→                    \n   806→                </div>\n   807→                \n   808→            </div>\n   809→            \n   810→        </section>\n   811→        </div>\n   812→\n   813→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   814→        <section>\n   815→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n   816→\n   817→            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n   818→            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n   819→                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n   820→                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n   821→                    Show only low-confidence items\n   822→                </label>\n   823→            </div>\n   824→\n   825→            \n   826→\n   827→            \n   828→            <div class=\"character-group\">\n   829→                <h3>Supporting Characters <span class=\"count\">2</span></h3>\n   830→                <table>\n   831→                    <thead>\n   832→                        <tr>\n   833→                            <th>Name</th>\n   